            Summary__c = '                             Social Media is low-cost way to connect and engage with customers by creating compelling content that showcases your hotel and the local area. Activating your hotel properly on Social Media does take a dedicated resources<!-- truncated -->',
            Body__c = '\n        <div class="container-fluid">\n            <!--<div class="row justify-content-center">\n                <div class="col-lg-5">\n                    <div class="section_tittle text-center">\n                        <p>recent work</p>\n                        <h2>Creative work for client</h2>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>-->\n            <div class="row">\n                <div class="col-lg-12">\n                    \n                    <div class="single_work">\n                        <div class="row align-items-center">\n                            <div class="container">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-8 padding_hub_1">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="about_text_left">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Social Media</h3>\n                             <p>Social Media is low-cost way to connect and engage with customers by creating compelling content that showcases your hotel and the local area. Activating your hotel properly on Social Media does take a dedicated resources and the information and tips below can help you determine if Social Media is right for you, and how to get started.</p> \n<ul id="content">\n\n<li><a href="?Action=GET&amp;ID=brandstandards/localmarketing/files/Social_Media_Guidelines_2026.pdf">Choice Hotels’ Social Media Guidelines for Hotels</a> (22 Pages PDF)</li>\n<li><a href="?Action=GET&amp;ID=brandstandards/localmarketing/files/Social_Media_Content_September_2023.pdf">Social Media Content Ideas</a> (2 Pages PDF)</li>\n<li><a href="?Action=GET&amp;ID=brandstandards/LocalMarketing/files/Social_Media_Calendar_Template_June_2023.xlsx">Content Calendar Template</a> (1 Sheet XLSX)</li>\n<li><a href="?Action=GET&amp;ID=brandstandards/localmarketing/files/Organic_Social_Media_Guide.pdf">Organic Social Media Guide</a> (1 Page PDF)</li>\n</ul>\n \n                             \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="about_text_right">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n   \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                   \n \n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    ',
